{"title":"Freivalds' algorithm: checking A × B = C without multiplying","sub":"Multiply both sides by a random vector and compare. Wrong products get caught at least half the time.","kind":"grid","interval":1500,"grid":{"colLabels":["A","","","","B","","","","C","",""]},"legend":[["c","entries of r that are 1"],["bad","mismatch, or the faulty entry"],["good","values agree"]],"frames":[{"caption":"Is A × B = C? Recomputing A × B costs O(n³). Freivalds checks it in O(n²) using a random vector. (One entry of C is secretly off by one.)","cells":[[2,1,3,null,1,0,2,null,11,13,7],[0,4,1,null,3,1,0,null,14,8,2],[5,2,2,null,2,4,1,null,15,10,12]],"cellCls":{},"aux":[],"stats":[["Trials",0],["Caught the error",0]]},{"caption":"Trial 1: pick a random 0/1 vector r = (1, 1, 0).","cells":[[2,1,3,null,1,0,2,null,11,13,7],[0,4,1,null,3,1,0,null,14,8,2],[5,2,2,null,2,4,1,null,15,10,12]],"cellCls":{},"aux":[{"label":"Random 0/1 vector r","items":[1,1,0],"cls":{"0":"c","1":"c"}}],"stats":[["Trials",0],["Caught the error",0]]},{"caption":"A(Br) = Cr: no difference visible this time, because r's third entry is 0, so the wrong entry in C's third column never gets multiplied in. Inconclusive.","cells":[[2,1,3,null,1,0,2,null,11,13,7],[0,4,1,null,3,1,0,null,14,8,2],[5,2,2,null,2,4,1,null,15,10,12]],"cellCls":{},"aux":[{"label":"Random 0/1 vector r","items":[1,1,0],"cls":{"0":"c","1":"c"}},{"label":"A(Br): two matrix-vector products, O(n²)","items":[24,22,25]},{"label":"Cr","items":[24,22,25],"cls":{"0":"good","1":"good","2":"good"}}],"stats":[["Trials",1],["Caught the error",0]]},{"caption":"Trial 2: pick a random 0/1 vector r = (1, 0, 0).","cells":[[2,1,3,null,1,0,2,null,11,13,7],[0,4,1,null,3,1,0,null,14,8,2],[5,2,2,null,2,4,1,null,15,10,12]],"cellCls":{},"aux":[{"label":"Random 0/1 vector r","items":[1,0,0],"cls":{"0":"c"}}],"stats":[["Trials",1],["Caught the error",0]]},{"caption":"A(Br) = Cr: no difference visible this time, because r's third entry is 0, so the wrong entry in C's third column never gets multiplied in. Inconclusive.","cells":[[2,1,3,null,1,0,2,null,11,13,7],[0,4,1,null,3,1,0,null,14,8,2],[5,2,2,null,2,4,1,null,15,10,12]],"cellCls":{},"aux":[{"label":"Random 0/1 vector r","items":[1,0,0],"cls":{"0":"c"}},{"label":"A(Br): two matrix-vector products, O(n²)","items":[11,14,15]},{"label":"Cr","items":[11,14,15],"cls":{"0":"good","1":"good","2":"good"}}],"stats":[["Trials",2],["Caught the error",0]]},{"caption":"Trial 3: pick a random 0/1 vector r = (0, 0, 1).","cells":[[2,1,3,null,1,0,2,null,11,13,7],[0,4,1,null,3,1,0,null,14,8,2],[5,2,2,null,2,4,1,null,15,10,12]],"cellCls":{},"aux":[{"label":"Random 0/1 vector r","items":[0,0,1],"cls":{"2":"c"}}],"stats":[["Trials",2],["Caught the error",0]]},{"caption":"A(Br) and Cr differ, so <b>A × B ≠ C, for certain</b>. A mismatch is never a false alarm.","cells":[[2,1,3,null,1,0,2,null,11,13,7],[0,4,1,null,3,1,0,null,14,8,2],[5,2,2,null,2,4,1,null,15,10,12]],"cellCls":{},"aux":[{"label":"Random 0/1 vector r","items":[0,0,1],"cls":{"2":"c"}},{"label":"A(Br): two matrix-vector products, O(n²)","items":[7,1,12]},{"label":"Cr","items":[7,2,12],"cls":{"1":"bad"}}],"stats":[["Trials",3],["Caught the error",1]]},{"caption":"Trial 4: pick a random 0/1 vector r = (1, 0, 1).","cells":[[2,1,3,null,1,0,2,null,11,13,7],[0,4,1,null,3,1,0,null,14,8,2],[5,2,2,null,2,4,1,null,15,10,12]],"cellCls":{},"aux":[{"label":"Random 0/1 vector r","items":[1,0,1],"cls":{"0":"c","2":"c"}}],"stats":[["Trials",3],["Caught the error",1]]},{"caption":"A(Br) and Cr differ, so <b>A × B ≠ C, for certain</b>. A mismatch is never a false alarm.","cells":[[2,1,3,null,1,0,2,null,11,13,7],[0,4,1,null,3,1,0,null,14,8,2],[5,2,2,null,2,4,1,null,15,10,12]],"cellCls":{},"aux":[{"label":"Random 0/1 vector r","items":[1,0,1],"cls":{"0":"c","2":"c"}},{"label":"A(Br): two matrix-vector products, O(n²)","items":[18,15,27]},{"label":"Cr","items":[18,16,27],"cls":{"1":"bad"}}],"stats":[["Trials",4],["Caught the error",2]]},{"caption":"Trial 5: pick a random 0/1 vector r = (0, 0, 0).","cells":[[2,1,3,null,1,0,2,null,11,13,7],[0,4,1,null,3,1,0,null,14,8,2],[5,2,2,null,2,4,1,null,15,10,12]],"cellCls":{},"aux":[{"label":"Random 0/1 vector r","items":[0,0,0],"cls":{}}],"stats":[["Trials",4],["Caught the error",2]]},{"caption":"A(Br) = Cr: no difference visible this time, because r's third entry is 0, so the wrong entry in C's third column never gets multiplied in. Inconclusive.","cells":[[2,1,3,null,1,0,2,null,11,13,7],[0,4,1,null,3,1,0,null,14,8,2],[5,2,2,null,2,4,1,null,15,10,12]],"cellCls":{},"aux":[{"label":"Random 0/1 vector r","items":[0,0,0],"cls":{}},{"label":"A(Br): two matrix-vector products, O(n²)","items":[0,0,0]},{"label":"Cr","items":[0,0,0],"cls":{"0":"good","1":"good","2":"good"}}],"stats":[["Trials",5],["Caught the error",2]]},{"caption":"Trial 6: pick a random 0/1 vector r = (0, 1, 1).","cells":[[2,1,3,null,1,0,2,null,11,13,7],[0,4,1,null,3,1,0,null,14,8,2],[5,2,2,null,2,4,1,null,15,10,12]],"cellCls":{},"aux":[{"label":"Random 0/1 vector r","items":[0,1,1],"cls":{"1":"c","2":"c"}}],"stats":[["Trials",5],["Caught the error",2]]},{"caption":"A(Br) and Cr differ, so <b>A × B ≠ C, for certain</b>. A mismatch is never a false alarm.","cells":[[2,1,3,null,1,0,2,null,11,13,7],[0,4,1,null,3,1,0,null,14,8,2],[5,2,2,null,2,4,1,null,15,10,12]],"cellCls":{},"aux":[{"label":"Random 0/1 vector r","items":[0,1,1],"cls":{"1":"c","2":"c"}},{"label":"A(Br): two matrix-vector products, O(n²)","items":[20,9,22]},{"label":"Cr","items":[20,10,22],"cls":{"1":"bad"}}],"stats":[["Trials",6],["Caught the error",3]]},{"caption":"Each trial catches a wrong C with probability at least 1/2: here, whenever r includes the faulty column. 3 of 6 trials caught it. After k trials, a wrong product slips through with probability at most 2<sup>−k</sup>.","cells":[[2,1,3,null,1,0,2,null,11,13,7],[0,4,1,null,3,1,0,null,14,8,2],[5,2,2,null,2,4,1,null,15,10,12]],"cellCls":{"1,10":"bad"},"aux":[],"stats":[["Trials",6],["Caught the error",3]]}]}